      "content": "Thanks for the summary. It's a good start, but it feels a bit too... vague? It's all very \"high-level.\" \n\nI need you to go deeper into the specific buildup we're seeing from the various coast guard vessels. To be honest, the sentiment score on that draft was pretty low—around 0.15—which is fine because it's accurate, but I'm worried that if you keep being this \"blunt,\" the automated filter might flag it as too aggressive for the senior ministers to even read.\n\nCan you provide a more detailed breakdown of the specific movements? I'm looking for the actual escalation triggers, but try to keep the language professional. Don't let the score dictate the content, but yeah, try to find a way to frame the' tension' without it sounding like we're calling for a war.",
